  "label": "The text 'the name's todd... retodd' maps to the man with Down syndrome in the image.",
  "description": "The textual element 'the name's todd... retodd' is overlaid on the image of a man with Down syndrome. The text creates an analogical mapping by identifying the man as 'Todd' (with a phonetic pun 'retodd' that is a derogatory slur). This mapping projects the textual identity ('Todd') onto the visual entity (the man), establishing a direct link between the text and the person depicted. The mapping is explicit through the text's content and its spatial placement over the man's image.",
